Description: ActivityTrack from the command line
 ActivityTrack records the work of freelancers and technicians: activities,
 travels, pauses and to-dos, on the Android app, on a web server of one's
 own and on the PC.
 .
 The activitytrack command starts, pauses and stops activities, completes
 them, lists and works the to-dos, and syncs with ActivityTrack Web; an
 interactive mode chooses from numbered lists, and --json prints what
 scripts read. It is the same application as the desktop tray application,
 on the same data and pairing.
